um factory MUST continue to use LangGraph exactly as specified.\\nDo not implement a Python replacement for that production runtime.\\nRun every pytest command as /tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest ...; never use python3, python, or plain pytest.\\nNode: N31_REPAIR_ACCEPTANCE\\nPatch provenance: {\\\"active_patch_ids\\\": [\\\"P-N31-001\\\"], \\\"base_prompt_sha256\\\": \\\"c540087d0e59c03f924ed65efecd23f18bd7079ec692486f010dd6464fb835a1\\\", \\\"effective_prompt_sha256\\\": \\\"5721bff7e17692b92bab4d4802929991421b585d6b91d321400b113e40dd6603\\\", \\\"patch_chain_sha256\\\": \\\"65a918ec93524292d7d3637107821d39bfb59acd2765b009a637a7484d2b16b6\\\", \\\"patch_ids\\\": [\\\"P-N31-001\\\"]}\\nDeclared writable paths: [\\\"runtime/langgraph_factory/repair.py\\\", \\\"runtime/langgraph_factory/acceptance.py\\\", \\\"runtime/langgraph_factory/graph.py\\\", \\\"tests/runtime/test_plan26_repair_acceptance.py\\\", \\\"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/N31_REPAIR_ACCEPTANCE.result.v1.md\\\", \\\"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/evidence/N31_REPAIR_ACCEPTANCE\\\"]\\nCompact predecessor state: {\\\"N30_UNIT_GRAPH\\\": {\\\"outputs\\\": {\\\"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/N30_UNIT_GRAPH.result.v1.md\\\": \\\"f04fbfcb10b95b3b0f86de7c88939c607f45c6cd60d1ee2d4ecf0df17db63ac3\\\", \\\"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/evidence/N30_UNIT_GRAPH\\\": \\\"c468b85043c905358dac9988a08f9bd95b51ae303426722a8a7d67559e857107\\\", \\\"runtime/langgraph_factory/graph.py\\\": \\\"eae00c21bfe55ce6e2d6c4374611db4d84d286218d498fa520e799288e152e26\\\", \\\"runtime/langgraph_factory/unit_graph.py\\\": \\\"286995f398826be63bc2263ea5148f87b23ee7683973e4245c4ee3687a6f309c\\\", \\\"tests/runtime/test_plan26_unit_graph.py\\\": \\\"914f6456429c81879bdaf0cacf54ba6b3e43b57f0fee2795ccfe0caf02e71d96\\\"}, \\\"receipt\\\": \\\"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/v3/N30_UNIT_GRAPH.receipt.v1.json\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"PASSED\\\"}}\\nDo not r